<title>SINGAPORE: Malaysia raises Tapis price 7-cents/bbl - traders.</title>
<headline>Malaysia raises Tapis price 7-cents/bbl - traders.</headline>
<dateline>SINGAPORE 1997-06-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>State-owned Petronas has raised the term lifting price of its Tapis crude oil by seven cents per barrel to $21.30 from $21.23 in April, traders said on Tuesday.</p>
</text>
